# Class axioms for the Cross-Functional Core (xfn), cycle 1: the ten attributed classes of
# section 4.1 of docs/specs/2026-10-14-xfn-semantic-layer-cycle-1-rerun.md, and nothing else.
# Loading another hierarchy in their place would make xfn-shapes.ttl wrong (spec 4.1).

@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xfn:  <https://ontos.dev/ontology/xfn/> .

xfn:Variable                   rdfs:subClassOf xfn:AttributedRecord .
xfn:Outcome                    rdfs:subClassOf xfn:AttributedRecord .
xfn:Decision                   rdfs:subClassOf xfn:AttributedRecord .
xfn:EffectClaim                rdfs:subClassOf xfn:AttributedRecord .
xfn:Commitment                 rdfs:subClassOf xfn:AttributedRecord .
xfn:TermDeviation              rdfs:subClassOf xfn:AttributedRecord .
xfn:EvidenceItem               rdfs:subClassOf xfn:AttributedRecord .
xfn:MetricVersion              rdfs:subClassOf xfn:AttributedRecord .
xfn:VariableOperationalisation rdfs:subClassOf xfn:AttributedRecord .
xfn:MetricBinding              rdfs:subClassOf xfn:AttributedRecord .
